pan begin="35.260" end="36.409">你注定要</span><span begin="36.409" end="36.889">为</span><span begin="36.889" end="37.177">我</span><span begin="37.177" end="38.409">绽放</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="38.032" end="39.215">(绽放)</span></span></p><p begin="38.741" end="42.551" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.741" end="39.162">我的</span><span begin="39.162" end="39.677">心</span> <span begin="39.677" end="40.608">寻找家</span> <span begin="40.701" end="41.142">我的</span><span begin="41.142" end="41.682">家</span> <span begin="41.682" end="42.551">没有花</span></p><p begin="42.580" end="46.937" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.580" end="43.296">我的花</span><span begin="43.296" end="44.514">却在这山谷</span><span begin="44.514" end="45.040">等着</span><span begin="45.040" end="46.937">我</span></p></div><div begin="47.104" end="54.860" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="47.104" end="54.638" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.104" end="47.804">若一开始</span><span begin="47.804" end="48.809">没有上帝</span><span begin="48.809" end="49.269">暗中</span><span begin="49.269" end="50.218">偷偷的怂</span><span begin="50.218" end="50.923">恿</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="50.441" end="50.757">(怂</span><span begin="50.757" end="54.638">恿)</span></span></p><p begin="50.887" end="54.860" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.887" end="51.866">我们怎知</span><span begin="51.866" end="52.556">选择相</span><span begin="52.556" end="54.061">逢</span> <span begin="54.061" end="54.860">Hoh</span></p></div><div begin="54.920" end="1:29.947" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="54.920" end="1:02.821" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.920" end="55.865">你是</span><span begin="55.865" end="56.443">心</span><span begin="56.443" end="57.341">中的</span><span begin="57.341" end="57.860">日</span><span begin="57.860" end="58.551">月</span> <span begin="58.736" end="59.719">落在</span><span begin="59.719" end="1:00.258">这</span><span begin="1:00.258" end="1:01.454">里